    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Increase user engagement and interaction with CrossTalk Comments wordpress plugin. Add comment threads, facebook-like live chat, video player with live chat, polls, AI summary and much more to keep your audience engaged and increase DAU, MAU and average time the user spends on your website.</p>\n<p>CrossTalk has a forever-free plan! Sign up now at  <a href=\"https://crosstalk.cc\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">crosstalk.cc</a></p>\n<h4>Docs and support</h4>\n<p>Facing issues? Read more at <a href=\"https://crosstalk.cc/docs/en\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">CrossTalk Documentation</a>. Find samples and recipes on our <a href=\"https://github.com/crosstalkcc\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GitHub</a>.<br />\nBy using our platform you accept our <a href=\"https://crosstalk.cc/tos.htm\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">ToS</a>. Read our <a href=\"https://crosstalk.cc/privacy.htm\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Go to “Plugins” &gt; “Add Plugin”</li>\n<li>Search for “CrossTalk Comments” by CrossTalk Audience Engagement Platform</li>\n<li>Click “Install Now”</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add gutenberg blocks for CrossTalk Polls, AI Summary and Video Player with Chat</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add correct activation hook to ensure comments are visible</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Add interactive comments, live chat, polls etc to your wordpress website for free.",
